{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675060/extras/9098be0c741ac8483c7970822d9f7a8f.avif?t=1749697115\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675060/extras_big/9098be0c741ac8483c7970822d9f7a8f.avif?t=1749697115 width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Goblin Gnome Horn&quot;</strong> is <strong>a casual 2D side-scrolling action game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players control a small goblin named &quot;Nekbi&quot; and aim to defeat the Demon King by collecting acorns through various mini-games such as &quot;chopping firewood&quot; and &quot;cleaning the toilet.&quot;</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Contents</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Labor&quot; - Simple mini-games such as only clicking or only moving up, down, left and right. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Battle&quot; - Side-scrolling action battles against the demon king.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is estimated that it will take about 2 hours to complete. It can be enjoyed casually.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Labor (Mini-game)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675060/extras/1d403b09630d79ac3b10ba2fd5062073.poster.avif?t=1749697115\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675060/extras/1d403b09630d79ac3b10ba2fd5062073.webm?t=1749697115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675060/extras/1d403b09630d79ac3b10ba2fd5062073.mp4?t=1749697115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbThere are a total of 6 types of labor (mini-games).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbYou can earn acorns depending on how well you do in the mini-games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbIf you get an S rank in a mini-game, you'll get a lot of acorns and new mini-games will be unlocked. Aim to get an S rank.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trading (shop)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675060/extras/ec7c6ff557647f53b6604398f3f76fc0.avif?t=1749697115\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675060/extras_big/ec7c6ff557647f53b6604398f3f76fc0.avif?t=1749697115 width=800 height=446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbYou can purchase equipment and skills with acorns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbYou'll need a lot of acorns to purchase powerful equipment, so play the mini-game multiple times.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675060/extras/d2de31bacb222e8de4311fdd169ba0e2.poster.avif?t=1749697115\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675060/extras/d2de31bacb222e8de4311fdd169ba0e2.webm?t=1749697115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675060/extras/d2de31bacb222e8de4311fdd169ba0e2.mp4?t=1749697115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbThe only enemy is the Demon King. He is in the next room, so you can challenge him anytime and as many times as you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbThe game is cleared when you defeat the Demon King.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Left click to attack, right click to parry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbYou can recover stamina by consuming acorns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbIt's up to you whether you defeat the Demon King by working hard and using strong equipment, or by using your own strength.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6\ufe0eText can be switched between Japanese and English.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6\ufe0eGameplay can be streamed.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3675060?t=1749697115","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675060/ff2aa5e049a7e41a64e1888ff030fe75bacd83e6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749697115","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675060/d49d9b942ba8ed19b58f78e90d178fefba80e8aa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749697115","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675060/d49d9b942ba8ed19b58f78e90d178fefba80e8aa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749697115","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675060/extras/9098be0c741ac8483c7970822d9f7a8f.avif?t=1749697115\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675060/extras_big/9098be0c741ac8483c7970822d9f7a8f.avif?t=1749697115 width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Goblin Gnome Horn&quot;</strong> is <strong>a casual 2D side-scrolling action game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players control a small goblin named &quot;Nekbi&quot; and aim to defeat the Demon King by collecting acorns through various mini-games such as &quot;chopping firewood&quot; and &quot;cleaning the toilet.&quot;</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Contents</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Labor&quot; - Simple mini-games such as only clicking or only moving up, down, left and right. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Battle&quot; - Side-scrolling action battles against the demon king.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is estimated that it will take about 2 hours to complete. It can be enjoyed casually.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Labor (Mini-game)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675060/extras/1d403b09630d79ac3b10ba2fd5062073.poster.avif?t=1749697115\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675060/extras/1d403b09630d79ac3b10ba2fd5062073.webm?t=1749697115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675060/extras/1d403b09630d79ac3b10ba2fd5062073.mp4?t=1749697115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbThere are a total of 6 types of labor (mini-games).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbYou can earn acorns depending on how well you do in the mini-games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbIf you get an S rank in a mini-game, you'll get a lot of acorns and new mini-games will be unlocked. Aim to get an S rank.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trading (shop)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675060/extras/ec7c6ff557647f53b6604398f3f76fc0.avif?t=1749697115\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675060/extras_big/ec7c6ff557647f53b6604398f3f76fc0.avif?t=1749697115 width=800 height=446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbYou can purchase equipment and skills with acorns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbYou'll need a lot of acorns to purchase powerful equipment, so play the mini-game multiple times.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675060/extras/d2de31bacb222e8de4311fdd169ba0e2.poster.avif?t=1749697115\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675060/extras/d2de31bacb222e8de4311fdd169ba0e2.webm?t=1749697115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675060/extras/d2de31bacb222e8de4311fdd169ba0e2.mp4?t=1749697115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbThe only enemy is the Demon King. He is in the next room, so you can challenge him anytime and as many times as you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbThe game is cleared when you defeat the Demon King.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Left click to attack, right click to parry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbYou can recover stamina by consuming acorns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbIt's up to you whether you defeat the Demon King by working hard and using strong equipment, or by using your own strength.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6\ufe0eText can be switched between Japanese and English.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6\ufe0eGameplay can be streamed.</p>","developers":["kawashiri_kodama","Kazuho"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675060/983e10367f6115ce02b794d4d51f2de723003da7/header.jpg?t=1749697115","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9\ufe0eKAWASHI